<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;There's no concept of attachments here. If you have code, enclose it in &lt;c&gt;&lt;code&gt;...&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/c&gt; tags. If you have lots of code, enclose it in &lt;c&gt;&lt;readmore&gt;...&lt;/readmore&gt;&lt;/c&gt; tags but only after remembering that the first S in [id://1177642|SSCCE] stands for "short".&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See also [id://17558].&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
